{"_id":"68841335a07fc7bfbc0d788c","title":"ChuxHub SaberShowdown ScriptV5","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7846a","gameId":12625784503,"name":"Saber Showdown","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1982d9f0bc0984a17348cfd8234d9d6afd67c45d95a91a860588d477e7ef73b6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c12dbf67a7eec35290d6a6e00ef26e31/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"12625784503-saber-showdown","path":"/game/12625784503-saber-showdown","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1982d9f0bc0984a17348cfd8234d9d6afd67c45d95a91a860588d477e7ef73b6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c12dbf67a7eec35290d6a6e00ef26e31/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":12625784503},"slug":"Saber-Showdown-ChuxHub-SaberShowdown-ScriptV5-46284","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":29929,"executes":5859,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/03e51af3df538d17db8c7a6b52af26994841d85eeb63ff8bba1ecb099557f240.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/12625784503-1753486132954.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/12625784503-1753486132954.webp"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/03e51af3df538d17db8c7a6b52af26994841d85eeb63ff8bba1ecb099557f240.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/12625784503-1753486132954.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/12625784503-1753486132954.webp"},"likeCount":6,"dislikeCount":3,"createdAt":"2025-07-25T23:28:53.042Z","updatedAt":"2025-07-25T23:28:53.042Z","lastBump":"2025-07-25T23:28:53.042Z","script":" loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastefy.app/7N6Cyk9i/raw\",true))()","features":"Of course. Here is a list of every feature included in the ChuxHub script.\n\nSaber Features\nAuto Perfect Block: A smart auto-block that detects specific incoming attack animations from nearby enemies and automatically performs the correct directional block.\n\nAuto-Engage Block: An automatic defense trigger. This feature forces your character to start blocking if you take damage or an enemy gets too close, so you don't have to manually hold the block button.\n\nSaber Style Selector: A dropdown menu to choose your lightsaber combat style.\n\nReset Saber: A button to quickly unequip and re-equip your lightsaber, which can fix some common glitches.\n\nSwing Speed Modifier: Allows you to increase or decrease the speed of your lightsaber swings and animations via a toggle and a textbox for a custom multiplier.\n\nKill Features\nTeleport Kill Aura: When activated, this powerful feature automatically finds the closest enemy within a set range, instantly teleports you to them, and executes an attack. This requires the \"Anti-Death\" feature to be enabled first.\n\nAdjustable Range: A textbox lets you define how far the Kill Aura will search for targets.\n\nOther Features\nAnti-Death: A core utility that enables the Kill Aura. It also functions as a constant auto-attack, repeatedly firing swing and attack commands.\n\nWalk Speed Cycler: A button to instantly cycle your character's walk speed through several preset values (16, 20, 24).\n\nJump Power Cycler: A button to instantly cycle your character's jump power through several preset values (50, 60, 70).\n\nGUI & Core Script Features\nDraggable Interface: The main hub window can be clicked and dragged anywhere on your screen.\n\nFull-Screen Loading Screen: An immersive loading screen with a progress bar when you first join.\n\nUI Toggle: You can hide or show the entire GUI at any time by pressing the Right Shift key.\n\nScrolling Tabs: A clean, organized layout with clickable tabs for \"Saber,\" \"Kill,\" \"Other,\" and \"Credits.\"\n\nRainbow Text Effect: Many titles and buttons feature a dynamic, color-changing rainbow effect.\n\nCredits Page: A dedicated tab crediting the creators of the hub.","tags":["exploit","script","updated"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"684759b1df5a1e3916